# What EAS Build uploads. This file REPLACES .gitignore for upload
# filtering — which is the point: the ancestor .gitignore carries
# `dist/` and `build/` patterns that strip real sources out of the
# vendored core trees (azahar's dist/compatibility_list, zstd's
# build/cmake). Git re-includes them via negations; EAS's ignore
# implementation does not honor re-inclusion inside an excluded
# directory, so those files silently never reached the build machine.
#
# Keep this list minimal and explicit.

node_modules/
.expo/
ios/
android/
*.log

# Never upload user content
**/roms/
**/saves/
**/states/
